    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d596">

                <pb facs="0699" n="613" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg613"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Cardinal Rampolla to
                        Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1903-07-23"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 23,
                    1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have not failed to convey to the Sacred College the heartfelt sympathy
                    expressed by you in the President’s name on the sad occasion of His Holiness’s
                    death.</p>
                <p>The Sacred College desires me to express to the President its deep and sincere
                    gratitude for such a noble manifestation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rampolla.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
